; Engine options for the kagex sample. The engine reads <exe name>.cf next to the executable
; (krkrz.cf beside krkrz and krkrz.exe); each line is a command-line option without its "-".
;
; orgname/appname name the save folder on Linux (~/.local/share/<orgname>/<appname>/) and
; macOS (~/Library/Application Support/<orgname>/<appname>/), so this game doesn't share
; ~/.local/share/wamsoft/krkrz/ with every other game on the stock engine. Windows saves to
; savedata/ next to the exe either way. A game made from the template should use its own names.
orgname=krkren
appname=kagex
